\title{zufuzz: Coverage-Guided Fuzzing for R Packages}
\description{
Instruments R code so that a coverage-guided fuzzing engine can search for inputs reaching new branches, and supplies the tooling around a campaign: a byte-driven data provider and R object generator, a harness launcher, crash artifacts with structured metadata, replay in a fresh process, and fingerprint-gated test case minimization. The engine itself is external and optional, so instrumentation, generation, replay, minimization and coverage reporting all work with nothing else installed.
